    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589-a1">

                <pb facs="0553" n="479" xml:id="pg479"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams with despatch
                    164.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>No. 1.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Corunna,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 4, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Charge d’ Affaires of the United States:</hi></p>
                <p>Having energetically protested to the authorities of Corunna and Ferrol, the
                    Stonewall went off to-day to Ferrol. Count on my faithfulness. I am an American
                    citizen.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FUENTES, <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
